sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client
    participant Controller as REST Controller
    participant Decoder as URLDecoder

    Client->>Controller: decodeParam(encodedText)
    Note over Client,Controller: Client calls method with URLencoded text
    
    Controller->>Decoder: URLDecoder.decode(encodedText, "UTF-8")
    Note over Controller,Decoder: Method invokes URLDecoder with UTF8 charset
    
    alt UnsupportedEncodingException
        Decoder-->>Controller: throw UnsupportedEncodingException
        Note over Decoder,Controller: Exception thrown for unsupported encoding
        
        Controller->>Controller: catch UnsupportedEncodingException
        Note over Controller: Exception caught in try-catch block
        
        Controller-->>Client: return ""
        Note over Controller,Client: Empty string returned on exception
    else Success
        Decoder-->>Controller: return decodedString
        Note over Decoder,Controller: Decoded string on success
        
        Controller-->>Client: return decodedString
        Note over Controller,Client: Decoded parameter string
    end